# Placeholder config for the fleet confirm-gate lint (chrischall/workflows,
# reusable-mcp-ci.yml). NOT credentials — never put one here. The lint starts
# dist/index.js with an empty environment and reads its tools/list. Under the
# default KIA_WRITE_MODE (comfort) the server does not register
# kia_lock_doors / kia_unlock_doors, so the lint could neither audit their
# annotations nor match manifest.json tools[], which lists the full roster.
# Registration needs no credentials or network, so this one line is enough.
KIA_WRITE_MODE=all
